# Apropos Design System

All UI in `app/` and `components/` MUST reuse the patterns below. Source of truth:
`app/ai/newsletter/NewsletterClient.tsx`, `app/ai/MainChatPanel.tsx`, `components/MiniMenu.tsx`.

DO NOT invent new color palettes, gradients, or token values. If a pattern is missing, copy
the closest existing one.

## Tokens

- **Font:** `font-poppins` on every panel root.
- **Backgrounds (dark):** `bg-[#080808]` (canvas), `bg-[#0a0a0a]` (full-page), `bg-[#0c0c0c]` (standalone header), `bg-[#141414]` (form fields), `bg-[#171717]` (input shells / side cards).
- **Embedded panels:** `bg-black/40 md:bg-black backdrop-blur-xl md:backdrop-blur-0` with `border border-white/15`.
- **Surface tints:** `bg-white/[0.02]`, `bg-white/[0.03]`, `bg-white/[0.05]`, `bg-white/[0.06]`. Hover steps up by ~50%.
- **Borders:** `border-white/[0.06]` (faint), `border-white/10`, `border-white/12` (default), `border-white/15`, `border-white/20`, `border-white/25`.
- **Radius:** `rounded-lg` (badges, segments, fields), `rounded-xl` (cards, sections, primary buttons), `rounded-2xl` (large containers, mini-menu).
- **Text:** `text-white` (primary), `text-white/85`, `/75`, `/70` (body), `/55`, `/45`, `/30` (subtle). Errors: `text-red-400/95`. Use `text-emerald-300` / `text-amber-300` / `text-rose-300` ONLY as small dot/badge accents, never as fills.
- **NEVER** use multi-stop gradients (`from-fuchsia-500 to-violet-500` etc.), neon colors, drop shadows beyond `shadow-[0_0_32px_-8px_rgba(255,255,255,0.18)]`, or emoji icons.

## Buttons (canonical strings)

```tsx
const primaryBtn =
  'w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-xl text-[14px] font-medium text-white transition-all duration-200 border border-white/10 bg-white/5 hover:border-white/20 hover:bg-white/10 hover:shadow-[0_0_32px_-8px_rgba(255,255,255,0.18)] disabled:opacity-40 active:scale-[0.99]';

const secondaryBtn =
  'w-full py-2.5 rounded-xl border border-white/12 text-[13px] text-white/75 hover:bg-white/[0.05] hover:border-white/18 disabled:opacity-40 transition-all duration-200 active:scale-[0.98]';

const dangerOutlineBtn =
  'w-full py-2.5 rounded-xl border border-white/25 text-[13px] text-white/90 hover:bg-white/[0.08] disabled:opacity-40 transition-all duration-200 active:scale-[0.98]';

const segBtn = (active: boolean) =>
  `rounded-lg px-2.5 py-1 text-[11px] font-medium tracking-wide transition-all duration-200 active:scale-[0.97] ${
    active ? 'bg-white/12 text-white shadow-sm border border-white/10' : 'text-white/45 hover:text-white/75'
  }`;

// Header close button (size-8)
const closeBtn =
  'flex size-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-white/12 bg-white/[0.06] text-white transition-all duration-200 hover:bg-white/[0.12] active:scale-[0.97]';

// Compact pill link (e.g. "← Tilbage")
const pillLink =
  'px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg border border-white/12 text-sm text-white/65 hover:bg-white/[0.06] hover:text-white/90 transition-all duration-200 active:scale-[0.98]';
```

## Panel header (embedded vs standalone)

```tsx
<header className={embedded
  ? 'border-b border-white/10 px-3 lg:px-4 py-2.5 lg:py-3 flex items-center justify-between gap-3 shrink-0 bg-black/25 backdrop-blur-md'
  : 'border-b border-white/10 px-4 lg:px-5 py-3 lg:py-4 flex items-center justify-between gap-3 shrink-0 bg-[#0c0c0c]'}>
  <h1 className={`font-medium tracking-tight text-white ${embedded ? 'text-[15px]' : 'text-[17px]'}`}>Title</h1>
  {/* close + segmented controls live here */}
</header>
```

## Collapsible / clickable section row

```tsx
<button type="button" onClick={...}
  className={`flex items-center gap-3 w-full px-3.5 py-2.5 rounded-xl border transition-all duration-200 active:scale-[0.98] ${
    open ? 'border-white/15 bg-white/[0.05]' : 'border-white/[0.06] hover:bg-white/[0.03]'
  }`}>
  <div className="flex size-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-white/[0.06] text-white/50">
    {/* 14px stroke-1.5 svg icon */}
  </div>
  <div className="flex-1 min-w-0 text-left">
    <p className="text-[12px] font-medium text-white/80">Label</p>
    <p className="text-[10px] text-white/30 truncate">Subtitle</p>
  </div>
  <svg className="size-3.5 shrink-0 text-white/25 transition-transform" /* chevron */ />
</button>
```

## Form fields

```tsx
className="w-full h-10 appearance-none pl-3 pr-3 rounded-lg border border-white/[0.12] bg-[#141414] text-[13px] text-white focus:border-white/25 focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-white/10 [color-scheme:dark]"
```

## Status badges & indicators

Status pills are **muted by default**. Use a small colored dot for tone, never a fill.

```tsx
<span className="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md border border-white/15 bg-white/[0.06] text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-white/70">
  <span className="size-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400" /> Publiceret
</span>
```

Tone-to-dot mapping: `bg-emerald-400` (ok), `bg-amber-400` (warn), `bg-rose-400` (err), `bg-white/40` (idle).

## Icons

- Inline SVG only. `viewBox="0 0 24 24"`, `stroke="currentColor"`, `strokeWidth={1.5}` for section icons / `2` for compact icons.
- Sizes: `size-3.5` (chevrons, header close inner), `width="14" height="14"` (in size-7 tile), `width="18" height="18"` (mini-menu), `width="22" height="22"` (mobile launcher tiles).

## Shell wrapper for embedded views

When mounted inside `AIWriterClient` (`embedded` prop), wrap the content in:

```tsx
<div className="h-full w-full flex flex-col font-poppins rounded-xl bg-black/40 md:bg-black backdrop-blur-xl md:backdrop-blur-0 border border-white/15 overflow-hidden md:outline md:outline-[1.5px] md:outline-offset-[-1.5px] md:outline-zinc-800">
  {/* header + scrollable content */}
</div>
```

Outer container is provided by `AIWriterClient` — only render the inner content.

## Chat shell (only in `MainChatPanel.tsx` and chat-like surfaces)

These patterns are NOT for general panels (use the canonical buttons + headers above).
They apply ONLY to conversational surfaces with a message list + composer.

### Message list container

```tsx
<div className="relative flex-1 min-h-0 overflow-hidden">
  <div ref={messageListRef}
    className="h-full overflow-y-auto space-y-4 nice-scrollbar"
    style={{ paddingBottom: inputSpacerHeight + 40 }}>
    {/* messages */}
  </div>
</div>
```

### Message bubbles

User bubble (right-aligned, dark fill, max 78%):

```tsx
'rounded-2xl px-4 py-3 transition-all duration-300 shadow-[0_18px_44px_-30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.8)] bg-black/90 text-white border border-white/20 hover:border-white/35 hover:bg-white/5 break-words overflow-wrap-anywhere'
```

Assistant bubble (left-aligned, no fill, soft text):

```tsx
'px-1.5 py-2 text-white/85 transition-all duration-300'
```

Layout: `flex justify-end|justify-start`, wrapper `max-w-[78%]`, user offset `md:ml-20`, assistant offset `md:mr-20`. Last message gets `animate-message-glow` for 1.5s.

### Inline option chips (suggestion pills inside an assistant bubble)

```tsx
'px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs transition-all border bg-white/5 text-white border-white/10 hover:border-white/20 hover:bg-white/10'
```

Suggestion CARDS (numbered list inside an assistant bubble):

```tsx
'p-3 bg-white/5 hover:bg-white/10 border border-white/10 hover:border-white/20 rounded-lg transition-all cursor-pointer group'
```
Title: `text-white text-sm font-medium ... group-hover:text-blue-300`. Subtitle: `text-white/40 text-xs line-clamp-2`. Right chevron: `w-4 h-4 text-white/30 group-hover:text-blue-400`.

### Composer (input shell)

Outer card — first message vs follow-up:

```tsx
// First message (empty chat): floating glow card
'relative rounded-xl bg-black/40 backdrop-blur-xl border border-white/15 shadow-[0_-18px_80px_-30px_rgba(255,255,255,0.28)]'
// After first message: solid dark card
'relative rounded-xl bg-[#171717] border border-white/15'
```

Inner padding: `p-3 md:p-4`.

Textarea: `w-full bg-transparent text-white text-sm resize-none outline-none`, `rows={3}`, `minHeight: 60px`.

Animated placeholder (only when empty, absolute-positioned overlay):

```tsx
<span className="text-sm bg-gradient-to-r from-white/20 via-white/70 to-white/20 bg-clip-text text-transparent"
  style={{ backgroundSize: '200% 100%', animation: 'gradient-shift 4s ease-in-out infinite' }}>
  Lad os starte med din artikel
</span>
```

Note: `gradient-shift` is the ONLY allowed multi-stop gradient and ONLY for placeholder shimmer.

Composer action button (icon, 44px touch target):

```tsx
'touch-target w-11 h-11 flex items-center justify-center rounded transition-colors text-white hover:bg-gray-700'
// active state: 'text-blue-400 bg-blue-400/10'
```

### Attached source pill (file/URL chip above composer)

```tsx
'inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 pl-2.5 pr-1 py-1 rounded-full bg-white/10 border border-white/15 text-xs text-white/80 max-w-[280px] hover:border-white/25 transition-colors'
```
Remove button inside: `flex-shrink-0 p-0.5 rounded-full text-white/30 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/10`.

### Thinking / loading indicators

Spinner (small, inline): `w-3.5 h-3.5 border-2 border-white/30 border-t-white rounded-full animate-spin inline-block`.

Step status text classes: `text-white` (active), `text-white/55` (pending), `text-white/30` (done).

For longer pipelines (Liv preview, Preflight) prefer the shared timeline — DO NOT invent a new spinner style.

## Don'ts

- ❌ No `bg-gradient-to-br from-fuchsia-500/20 ...` style backgrounds.
- ❌ No `text-[20px]` font sizes outside h1/h2 of standalone pages.
- ❌ No `rounded-3xl`, `rounded-full` (except dots/avatars).
- ❌ No emoji as UI icon.
- ❌ No new color values — if you need a tint, pick from the surface scale above.
- ❌ Don't centre everything — left-align text, use `gap-2` / `gap-3` between siblings.
